WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:25.759
Shri Ganesha is a giver of wisdom. He’s a giver 
of wisdom, means just wisdom becomes a dharma,

2
00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:29.519
becomes a part and parcel 
of your being. You become just wise.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.899
Now somebody may ask, “Mother how to become 
wise?” It’s very difficult to say

4
00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:39.779
how to become wise. It is just that it 
happens that you become wise.

5
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:47.099
So, though He’s a child, He’s so matured. 
He’s so wise. And He’s not only that,

6
00:00:47.099 --> 00:00:59.139
but He emits wisdom. And this wisdom is an innate 
quality of anyone who is a Sahaja Yogi.

7
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.559
Because in him, also, Shri Ganesha has been 
awakened. So, he becomes a wise person,

8
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:17.240
very wise, and with wisdom what does he 
achieve? He achieves a balance, a proper ascent

9
00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:24.560
and also he understands that this ascent is 
for his benevolence, for the benevolence of his country,

10
00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:29.179
benevolence of the whole world. He 
understands the importance of Sahaja Yoga.

11
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:42.501
Without this wisdom, one cannot understand. 
And this wisdom is within us, just absolutely, innately built-in.

12
00:01:42.681 --> 00:01:48.860
Only thing is, we have to 
use the storehouse of this wisdom that is within us.

13
00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:51.699
In that wisdom, you throw away whatever is wrong.

14
00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.074
So, what a great work this Ganesha has to 
do within ourselves!

15
00:01:58.497 --> 00:02:03.503
This manifestation of Ganesha within us is very important, I think.

16
00:02:03.803 --> 00:02:10.624
Not that it is only the basis, but also the foundation stone of spiritual 
life is Shri Ganesha.

17
00:02:12.112 --> 00:02:22.159
Once you are changed within, then you have full 
idea as to what is expected of others,

18
00:02:22.159 --> 00:02:29.221
what  they should do, what you are doing and how to 
deal with them and how to talk to them, how to tell them,

19
00:02:29.742 --> 00:02:34.299
how far to go with them – 
everything. All this comes through wisdom.

20
00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:41.059
In Sahaja Yoga, as you know, you are very 
capable people, you have achieved a lot,

21
00:02:41.059 --> 00:02:44.239
you know everything, you know all about chakras.

22
00:02:44.239 --> 00:02:47.238
You  know practically everything. I 
don’t hav to tell you anything.

23
00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:55.601
Despite all that, one should have also the 
wisdom how to deal with others, how to talk to others,

24
00:02:55.821 --> 00:03:05.000
how to behave towards others, how not 
to control anyone, not to say something that

25
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:12.500
will be rather harsh or hurting.
Because, if you are trying to spread Sahaja Yoga,

26
00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:19.359
this is the only way we can go forward, is
to look after everyone with great compassion.

27
00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:29.580
Now, we might think that wisdom is there 
with us and we know how to do so many things

28
00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:38.302
with our wisdom and now we are absolutely  wise. I agree, with Sahaja Yogis, now they have  become really very, very wise

29
00:03:38.302 --> 00:03:40.716
and they know 
how to use their wisdom.

30
00:03:42.198 --> 00:03:48.497
But still, faith in themselves has to be really on a Nirvikalpa state.

31
00:03:48.497 --> 00:03:54.000
That is only possible also with Shri Ganesha, because He is in Nirvikalpa.

32
00:03:54.358 --> 00:03:57.519
So, in wisdom you don’t have to think,  argue.

33
00:03:57.519 --> 00:04:04.000
I’ve seen many people who say, “Mother, you
see, we were thinking , then we had vibrations.

34
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.899
We didn’t know what to do, this, that,
how to do, how to correct, how to work it out”.

35
00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:18.879
Now, I must say this is a state. It is not 
a state to be achieved, but it’s a state.

36
00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:26.737
Means you are there. It has to be innately built 
in yourself, this state of wisdom.

37
00:04:26.737 --> 00:04:37.440
But you can  also work it out by just concentrating on yourself 
and trying to find out what’s the matter with me,

38
00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:41.650
what happens to me, why, 
why is it I’m like this.

39
00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:50.000
The introspection can help you a lot to be extremely wise, but easier method is to worship

40
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:59.520
the principle of innocence within yourself.
So, the first thing is live in the present.

41
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:06.718
The wisdom is in living in the present. Present, we are here, so forget the past.

42
00:05:07.339 --> 00:05:12.059
Now, if I say,  “Forget the past”, one may say, “How to do it?
How to forget the past?”

43
00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:22.049
Again, I would say, meditation is the only way. You give up your left and you give up your right and you are just standing in the centre,

44
00:05:22.049 --> 00:05:27.720
enjoying the wisdom, enjoying the joy of your being.

45
00:05:29.342 --> 00:05:32.000
So, this wisdom is to live in the present,

46
00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:38.939
This is a very good practice. One has to 
practice wisdom through living in the present.

47
00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:49.099
That’s how you can really establish yourself in 
wisdom, itself, means the wisdom acts by itself.

48
00:05:49.672 --> 00:05:55.719
It’s a power. Wisdom is a very big power. If 
you are a wise person, it’s a power.

49
00:05:55.719 --> 00:06:01.158
It can combat any kind of ignorance, any kind of 
attacks, any kind of stupidity.

50
00:06:02.499 --> 00:06:11.468
It’s such a tremendous power that God has given us, that 
we are wise. And this wisdom, you should try to really,

51
00:06:11.468 --> 00:06:15.798
to develop it and mature it properly within ourselves.

52
00:06:17.257 --> 00:06:26.041
So, today’s Shri Ganesha’s Puja is there, while  we should ask for wisdom. And for that, we have to be in the present.

53
00:06:26.762 --> 00:06:29.135
Every way you should be in the present.

54
00:06:39.352 --> 00:06:47.202
Now all these qualities described, of the Devi 
[that] are left sided, are in the brain: memory,

55
00:06:47.522 --> 00:06:54.178
‘smruti rupena sansthita’. Other things also 
– whatever are described – are in the brain.

56
00:06:54.639 --> 00:07:00.558
And then the bhakti reaches the stage [where] it just neutralises everything.

57
00:07:01.281 --> 00:07:04.724
All the problems of the brain are neutralised

58
00:07:04.724 --> 00:07:12.582
and you become a wise person. So the greatest boon of the Devi is to give you wisdom.

59
00:07:13.904 --> 00:07:16.620
You can call  it awareness, you can call it anything,

60
00:07:16.760 --> 00:07:25.481
but it’s a kind of a wisdom by which 
you become absolutely a Divine personality.

61
00:07:26.803 --> 00:07:29.659
That wisdom you must reach through your bhakti.

62
00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:37.619
It should not be blind, it should not be blind, 
but it should be wise bhakti, wise with wisdom.

63
00:07:37.959 --> 00:07:43.639
Only possible through Sahaja Yoga, I think, 
otherwise, whatever bhakti people do like mad,

64
00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.000
that cannot be bhakti.

65
00:07:45.741 --> 00:07:52.762
So many complaints come to me, about Sahaja 
Yogis also. I am surprised, why: why are they doing like that?

66
00:07:53.463 --> 00:07:57.559
I would say, still, 
they have not reached the state of bhakti.

67
00:07:57.559 --> 00:08:08.640
We get into diseases and we are trapped into 
all kinds of things; it is because we don’t have bhakti.

68
00:08:09.501 --> 00:08:16.301
In the bhakti, you have to depend 
on the wisdom of the Mother, wisdom of the Shakti,

69
00:08:16.461 --> 00:08:23.319
that She looks after you, She finds you out the way and She will help you.

70
00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:32.021
Now first test your wisdom, you must test your 
wisdom, “If I am doing this, is this wise, is it good,

71
00:08:32.021 --> 00:08:40.000
why I am doing it?” First test your wisdom, then you’ll find out that many things you do which are wrong,

72
00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:42.099
which should not have been done.

73
00:08:42.099 --> 00:08:48.680
But first your wisdom must develop and you 
must see that your wisdom works and helps you.

74
00:08:48.999 --> 00:08:56.178
If you  cannot find out what is good and what is 
bad that means the wisdom is lacking.

75
00:08:56.918 --> 00:09:02.558
If you cannot find out what should you 
do then the wisdom is lacking.

76
00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:11.119
But, if you have the wisdom, then you 
will immediately know that this is wrong.

77
00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:18.740
And the wisdom is the thing which really is not 
just assumption that, “I am very wise and all that,”

78
00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:25.100
but it asserts, it works out and 
it shows what is good and what is bad.

79
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:33.939
Wisdom is the sign of a person who is really a 
realised soul of a very high level.

80
00:09:34.179 --> 00:09:41.018
If you don’t have wisdom whatever you may do, you might 
feel satisfied about it,

81
00:09:41.018 --> 00:09:48.841
but the wisdom part is very, very important.
That is the most governing part within us

82
00:09:48.841 --> 00:09:57.399
and as you know, Ganesha is the giver of wisdom.
That’s why Ganesha must be worshipped.

83
00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:13.840
With a proper upbringing Shri Ganesha is 
established, who is nothing but the giver of wisdom.

84
00:10:19.226 --> 00:10:27.399
And this wisdom is innate. You don’t 
have to judge it, it’s innate within us,

85
00:10:27.399 --> 00:10:33.836
grown up, just like any other qualities in us.
It takes time with some people,

86
00:10:36.199 --> 00:10:50.518
it takes time,  no doubt. But once it comes in, such a person
becomes quiet, simple and absolutely truthful.

87
00:10:51.759 --> 00:11:01.000
He knows about everything. And this is the 
thing one should develop is, “How far am I wise?”

88
00:11:01.921 --> 00:11:05.760
He’s not worried about his financial side,

89
00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:12.739
or emotional side, nothing! What he is worried is,
“Have I been a wise person?”

90
00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:23.141
That is the first sign of the blessings of God.
The one who has blessings of Divine is a wise person,

91
00:11:24.042 --> 00:11:28.840
he’s very wise and his wisdom is
shown by his silence.

92
00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:33.159
we have developed this wisdom 
within us, through what?

93
00:11:33.419 --> 00:11:41.177
Through our meditation, through our 
understanding of bhakti and shraddha.

94
00:11:41.177 --> 00:11:49.111
So it’s very important to understand 
the value of bhakti within us.

95
00:11:49.371 --> 00:11:56.199
You cannot superficially touch it. Those who 
are superficial will never get it.

96
00:11:56.199 --> 00:12:06.519
Wisdom only comes through understanding what is wisdom is.

97
00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:16.031
So the Sahaj Yogi is the one who has to have 
that wisdom, “Why I am doing this? What is the need to do it?”

98
00:12:16.031 --> 00:12:22.880
They don’t have to ask any questions, they just don’t do wrong things. They just don’t do wrong things.

99
00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:28.022
They are always on the right path. That is the sign of a Sahaj Yogi, I believe,

100
00:12:28.522 --> 00:12:35.282
and which is the blessing  of the Goddess. If there is the Power of the Goddess working in you,

101
00:12:35.783 --> 00:12:38.179
you will  have the wisdom to work it out.

102
00:12:38.379 --> 00:12:48.360
For a person who is standing in his wisdom, is 
the sage as they call him, is the saint as they call it.

103
00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:58.730
But, this can be every Sahaja Yogi could be a saint, could be a sage, every Sahaja Yogi could be that.

104
00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:03.479
But if you lose 
your wisdom then you are no good.

105
00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:08.560
So, I have to tell you one thing: 
it’s your wisdom which will save you.

106
00:13:10.422 --> 00:13:15.613
Your wisdom will
unconsciously help you.

107
00:13:15.613 --> 00:13:20.555
there are many incidents people have told 
me, that, “Mother, how we were saved,

108
00:13:20.555 --> 00:13:31.004
how we were brought to the brink of death 
and then how we are just alive.”

109
00:13:31.004 --> 00:13:39.821
It is because the Divine needs you, Divine doesn’t 
want you to die, or to finish off, it needs you very much.

110
00:13:39.821 --> 00:13:44.918
It has to do its work and you 
are the instrument of that Divine.

111
00:13:44.918 --> 00:13:51.477
If you have wisdom you are the best instrument 
for the Divine to work it out.

112
00:13:51.477 --> 00:13:59.520
you should try to find out – are you wise 
enough? Are you wise, or are you not?

113
00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:05.000
It’s very difficult for every human being to 
find out whether you are right or wrong

114
00:14:05.641 --> 00:14:16.080
because you see the effects of this wisdom all around.
So, the bhakti and shraddha to the Goddess gives you,

115
00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:25.822
definitely gives you, wisdom. We
have had some people in India who did  lots of bhakti, so called,

116
00:14:27.484 --> 00:14:33.580
and showed lots of
shraddha, but they were not, they were not.

117
00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:40.380
Just they were talking about it, or doing all
kinds of things about it but they were not.

118
00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:46.660
So wisdom is something a very innate 
quality, very innate, it’s not superficial.

119
00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:51.239
You cannot just say that 
this person is wise or not.

120
00:14:51.459 --> 00:15:00.721
It shows, that’s just like a power, it’s a 
power of understanding and is supported by the Power of the Goddess.

121
00:15:01.081 --> 00:15:06.102
So She is the giver of wisdom. This is the biggest quality of the Goddess,

122
00:15:06.683 --> 00:15:13.282
that She is the giver of wisdom. And wisdom comes as a part of the evolutionary process.

123
00:15:13.542 --> 00:15:16.640
Now She has brought about all the evolution so far,

124
00:15:16.640 --> 00:15:21.559
and to go further She is going to make you a very wise person.

125
00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:31.641
First of all you must follow only thing that is 
real, not unreal things. For that also, again, you need wisdom.

126
00:15:32.001 --> 00:15:36.960
I think for that you need 
wisdom very much more. And that is something,

127
00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:41.657
whether you have the wisdom first, or you have 
the blessings of the Mother, is between the two.

128
00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:52.039
So I have to tell you one thing that: before 
you people start spreading Sahaja Yoga,

129
00:15:52.039 --> 00:16:01.422
please judge yourself. Just see if you are wise enough.
Also see for yourself if you have the blessings of the Mother.

130
00:16:01.962 --> 00:16:12.446
Only the wise are, I should say,  the people who know whether they have the Mother’s blessings or not.

131
00:16:14.077 --> 00:16:21.119
For that we have so many ways of understanding.
First and foremost thing is meditation

132
00:16:21.119 --> 00:16:29.600
and feeling your vibrations on the photograph and
facing yourself clearly.

133
00:16:30.872 --> 00:16:38.020
If you are a realised soul, are you really a 
good realised soul or not? Are you deep or not?

134
00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:47.040
Are your vibrations working out or not?
If you can see that then you will realise that

135
00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:58.880
greater than all ambitions, the greatest is to
become a devoted, wise personality.

136
00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:07.461
But, on the whole, what I feel is you can 
support me very much, you can support my work very much,

137
00:17:07.902 --> 00:17:12.639
if you have that wisdom.
And the wisdom is to judge yourself:

138
00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:20.041
how many people you love? How you love?
How you talk to them? What do you want out of them?

139
00:17:20.181 --> 00:17:24.480
All this should come. 
Judge yourself – introspection.

140
00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:30.000
Through introspection you can see it.
So, for a Sahaja Yogi is important is  introspection.

141
00:17:32.203 --> 00:17:41.501
Second one is meditation. 
And third one is to take vibrations. It’s very important.

142
00:17:53.235 --> 00:18:04.975
The first thing is that if you want your Gurupad,  you have to be innocent. “Innocent” is a very vague term, very vague,

143
00:18:07.852 --> 00:18:13.043
and it’s difficult to really understand what is innocent.

144
00:18:14.104 --> 00:18:18.758
But what is the nature of innocence? That we can understand

145
00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:37.042
from Shri Ganesha’s innocence. First of
all, He’s endowed with wisdom, and He puts wisdom into us.

146
00:18:38.321 --> 00:18:52.806
It’s a nice thing now in modern times we have discovered genetics, and genetics determine our behaviour and our races.

147
00:18:53.771 --> 00:19:07.567
It is He who puts genetics in us. He selects and  puts it within us, our genetics,

148
00:19:09.507 --> 00:19:16.497
and when He puts wisdom in us, then we are wise.

149
00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:30.000
There is definitely a genetic of wisdom which  is lacking, as we can see very clearly, in many races. They have no wisdom.

150
00:19:31.141 --> 00:19:40.000
They do things without wisdom. They do things just for their destruction, destroying their society.

151
00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:44.059
They may call themselves the highest society, highest races,

152
00:19:44.059 --> 00:19:48.023
whatever it is – you may brand yourself with anything – but you can see from their behaviour

153
00:19:48.023 --> 00:19:50.646
that they have no wisdom at all.

154
00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:58.697
So He’s the one who puts that wisdom in us.

155
00:19:59.138 --> 00:20:07.662
In some people who are not yet evolved – certain 
races are not yet evolved to that extent – this wisdom is lacking.

156
00:20:10.225 --> 00:20:18.235
Apart from that, this 
wisdom gives us the sense of freedom.

157
00:20:21.218 --> 00:20:34.580
So we keep aloof from all kinds of intoxicants, all 
kinds of bad habits. We don’t like to look at nudity.

158
00:20:36.963 --> 00:20:41.035
It can never become the lifestyle 
of people who have wisdom. Never.

159
00:20:44.399 --> 00:20:55.299
We don’t indulge into extramarital nonsense. Whatever 
is absolutely in the centre, which is dharmic,

160
00:20:56.140 --> 00:21:06.220
we accept. So we can see that the seed of wisdom put into us makes us dharmic people

161
00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:11.258
when we grow, automatically. We are automatically dharmic.

162
00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:24.022
This wisdom comes to you through Shri Ganesh. 
In short, He makes you absolutely ready for Self-Realization.

163
00:21:26.044 --> 00:21:31.561
So this wisdom is innate. It just happens

164
00:21:31.561 --> 00:21:42.482
that when the Kundalini is rising, He becomes
manifesting in us – I should say, He makes us  like a child.

165
00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:51.222
And that’s what Christ has said, that you have to be like children if you have to enter into the Kingdom of God.

166
00:21:52.944 --> 00:21:57.418
You become
the child, at that time you become a child.

167
00:21:58.679 --> 00:22:07.422
And with the Kundalini rising, that wisdom then
comes into your brain, because He’s sitting on the Kundalini itself.

168
00:22:07.422 --> 00:22:13.619
He’s the power in the
Kundalini. He gives wisdom in the brain.

169
00:22:14.039 --> 00:22:23.420
Once you get that wisdom, you drop out all 
bad habits. All your attachments which are wrong,

170
00:22:24.041 --> 00:22:33.161
all adharmic things that you do, everything 
drops out. He changes, your genetics are changed.

171
00:22:33.541 --> 00:22:39.020
The genetics of Sahaja Yogis are 
that all of them will be the same. About the same, I would say.

172
00:22:40.042 --> 00:22:45.758
And the genetics 
of other people would be different.

173
00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:52.059
A child who has wisdom is extremely cautious, 
he understands the importance of his life.

174
00:22:52.339 --> 00:22:57.799
He respects his parents, he respects everything 
– automatically. You don’t have to tell them.

175
00:22:59.381 --> 00:23:02.617
Automatically they know what 
dharma is, you don’t have to tell them.

176
00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:14.378
That wisdom, this great deity of Ganesha gives you. He took His form as Jesus Christ.

177
00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:27.740
And you all accepted Him as the Lord, which is 
true also. But because your Ganesh principle

178
00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:34.906
was not so much developed in these Western 
countries, people took to stupid things.

179
00:23:35.889 --> 00:23:40.088
As soon as you get wisdom, you 
understand holiness and auspiciousness.

180
00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:48.881
So this wisdom part is so important, and 
that’s what we should ask Ganesha: to make us like children.

181
00:23:49.061 --> 00:23:56.180
Children have basically wisdom, 
but not all the children. This is the thing,

182
00:23:56.180 --> 00:24:03.440
that children in which Shri Ganesha has 
activated, has put this genetic of wisdom, it is there.

183
00:24:07.022 --> 00:24:16.281
This is one of the greatest things we have 
to think about: is it wise, it is sane? It’s not to be logically;

184
00:24:16.281 --> 00:24:21.061
logically if you believe in  something, then you can go wrong because there’s no strength from within.

185
00:24:22.222 --> 00:24:26.059
But innately if it becomes that, you won’t do it at any cost.

186
00:24:26.059 --> 00:24:36.499
I mean, for today, as it is we had to delay, and 
I’ve tried to give you some points about Shri Ganesh.

187
00:24:37.361 --> 00:24:41.800
I think even if you give Me a hundred 
lectures I cannot finish it, it’s so great.

188
00:24:41.800 --> 00:24:47.803
It’s like an ocean to Me. So I hope 
you will understand the essential,

189
00:24:48.176 --> 00:24:53.732
the fundamental principles
of Shri Ganesha, and what innocence is.

190
00:24:54.052 --> 00:24:55.394
The first is wisdom.

191
00:25:01.381 --> 00:25:03.381
May God bless you all.

